<li> All staff assigned to perform the planned risk management activities are appropriately skilled.</li>
</ul>
<div><p><b>Criteria for “Incomplete” Response:</b></p></div>
<ul>
<li> Some staff assigned have the skill necessary to perform their roles.</li>
</ul>' WHERE [Mat_Question_Id] = 3407
