UPDATE [dbo].[MATURITY_QUESTIONS] SET [Supplemental_Info]='<div><p><b>Question Intent:</b></p></div> To ensure that improvements to the external dependency management process are documented and shared across the organization.

<ul>
<li> Documenting lessons learned during the execution and review of the external dependency management process facilitates the proposal of improvements to the process.</li>
