<li> lessons learned in managing an external entity</li>
<li> improvements based on risk identification and mitigation</li>
<li> improvements based on executed or tested service continuity plans that rely on external entities</li>
</ul>

<div><p><b>Criteria for “Yes” Response:</b></p></div>
<ul>
<li> Improvements to external dependency management processes are documented and shared across the organization.</li>
</ul>
<div><p><b>Criteria for “Incomplete” Response:</b></p></div>
